SCRATCH ROOT: /tmp/audit-work/103-rounded-avg
SOURCE POLICY: candidate solution/spec/verification copied; trusted prompt,
translator, and /reference/reference-semantics copied; no *-kompiled tree or
cache copied from /candidate.

COMMAND: python3 py2mpy.py solution.py > solution.regenerated.mpy
EXIT STATUS: 0
OUTPUT: (none)

COMMAND: cmp solution.regenerated.mpy solution.mpy
EXIT STATUS: 0
OUTPUT: (none)

COMMAND: kompile reference-semantics/semantics.k --backend llvm --main-module MPY-KRUN --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX --output-definition audit-runtime-kompiled
EXIT STATUS: 0
RELEVANT OUTPUT: Build succeeded. The compiler emitted supplied-semantics
non-exhaustive-match warnings for mapStrVS, floorFI, toF, ceilF, joinCodes, and
valSeqAt, plus unused-variable warnings in strLt. No error was emitted.

COMMAND: krun runtime-tests.mpy --definition audit-runtime-kompiled
EXIT STATUS: 0
RELEVANT OUTPUT:
<generatedTop>
  <k> .K </k>
  ...
  <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>
</generatedTop>

COMMAND:
python3 - <<'PY'
import ast
sol = ast.parse(open('solution.py', encoding='utf-8').read()).body[0]
test = ast.parse(open('runtime-tests.py', encoding='utf-8').read()).body[0]
print('function_ast_equal=', ast.dump(sol, include_attributes=False) == ast.dump(test, include_attributes=False))
PY
EXIT STATUS: 0
OUTPUT: function_ast_equal= True

COMMAND: kompile verification.k --backend haskell --main-module ROUNDED-AVG-VERIFICATION --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX --output-definition audit-verification-kompiled
EXIT STATUS: 0
RELEVANT OUTPUT: Build succeeded. Only the supplied strLt unused-variable
warnings were emitted.

